{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港股跌幅擴大至逾400點，恒生指數失守23000點關口，是近3星期以來首次，低見22869點，跌近425點，跌幅逾1.8%。<br/>\n<br/>\n科技指數報3655點，跌約2.2%。<br/>\n<br/>\n騰訊績後急挫近6%，阿里巴巴業績公布前亦跌逾5%，連跌10個交易日，兩者拖低大市。<br/>\n<br/>\nAI大模型沽壓較大，兩大晶片股逆市向上。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:44:03.313905+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:37:32.173127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:37:32.173127+00:00","content_hash":"ba613a11db8dfe48509ab3fc72dab21fe9fd60b467398c6d460f8ee463d8266c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}